    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe arrow indicates that you can use the \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17094\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qsimp.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17094\u0026quot;,214)\"\u003e key to simplify the fraction one factor at a time.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17095\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qsimp.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17095\u0026quot;,214)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17096\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17096\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator factors out a 3 from the numerator and denominator.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_3_1_numbertheory_6_20/f-20-6-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
